    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "AWS 把统一 JSON 搜索拆给六个服务",
      "summary": "Ezat Karimi 的思路是不指望单一数据库扛下所有 JSON 场景。以视频平台为例，实时用户状态放 DynamoDB，影片目录放 DocumentDB，计费用 Aurora PostgreSQL 保证 ACID，数据湖落 S3，分析用 Redshift 的 SUPER 类型，内容发现交给 OpenSearch。各服务之间靠 OpenSearch Ingestion 做快照加持续变更捕获，在可接受的窗口内保持最终一致。",
      "url": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/database/how-to-build-unified-json-search-solutions-in-aws/",
      "author": "Ezat Karimi",
      "source": "AWS 数据库博客",
      "source_date": "2026-04-08",
      "image": "https://d2908q01vomqb2.cloudfront.net/887309d048beef83ad3eabf2a79a64a389ab1c9f/2026/04/01/ezatk_OS_architecture-1201x630.png",
      "domain": "cloud",
